Bottom Line
The week expanded treatment boundaries in moderate aortic stenosis and hepati=
tis delta while sharply narrowing confidence in biomarker-led cardiovascular =
development. FDA=E2=80=99s November 14 ivonescimab decision is the next major=
 test: approval would show how much regulatory weight progression-free surviv=
al can carry when overall survival misses statistical significance.
